Orchestrator. Recommend the P0 and the four P1s land as contract revision 2 before freeze; hand the exchange purge and the temp-path hardening to Merlin, and route the forged-edge reachability judgment to Vulcan, who should treat the incomplete-clone vector as in scope for the surface review.

